<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφαντ-άζομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be associated in
				idea with</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ
			ἀποθανεῖν</span>] 
			<i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be imagined</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be mirrored in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.6.17
			</span></i>; <i>take visible shape</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν ὕλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.8.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm.Math.</u>
				14
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>have visions</i>, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.110B.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
